---
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../config/site';
import { PILLARS } from '../data/pillars';
---

<section class="border-b-4 border-ink bg-paper py-12 sm:py-16">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight sm:text-6xl">
        What do{' '}
        <span class="inline-block border-2 border-ink bg-highlight px-2.5 py-0.5 shadow-zine-sm">
          YOU
        </span>{' '}
        want to see in Allston-Brighton's future?
      </h1>

      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-ink/90 sm:text-lg">
        <p>
          Right now, the <strong>{SITE_CONFIG.organizationName}</strong> is writing the
          <strong>Allston-Brighton Community Plan (ABCP)</strong>, the city's plan for where
          new housing goes, how our streets work, and what our cultural spaces look like for the next
          several decades. The city is aiming to release the plan in
          <strong>{SITE_CONFIG.planReleaseTarget}</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Over 75% of Allston-Brighton rents, yet this population is heavily underrepresented
          in city planning meetings. Check out the three big issues below,
          keep an eye out for{' '}
          <a
            href={SITE_CONFIG.links.officialPlanUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="font-bold underline decoration-2 underline-offset-2 hover:text-culture"
          >
            upcoming public meetings
          </a>
          , and send a comment in under a minute.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Pillar Jump Buttons -->
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
      {
        PILLARS.map((pillar) => (
          <a
            href={`#${pillar.id}`}
            class="zine-card-hover group flex flex-col justify-between p-5"
          >
            <div>
              <div class={`h-2 w-12 border border-ink ${pillar.bgClass}`} />
              <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">
                {pillar.title}
              </h2>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-ink/80">
                {pillar.heroButtonSubtitle}
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-5 flex items-center justify-between border-t-2 border-ink pt-3 font-display text-sm font-bold">
              <span>Explore</span>
              <span
                class={`inline-flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center border-2 border-ink text-white transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 ${pillar.bgClass}`}
              >
                ↓
              </span>
            </div>
          </a>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
